      "text": "R-1 religious workers no longer need to reside and be physically present outside the United States for one year at the end of their statutory five-year maximum admission period of stay to be eligible for readmission in R-1status.\n\nThis improvement will promote stability and minimize disruptions to the essential services provided by nonimmigrant religious workers in the United States.\n\nLearn more: https://t.co/PNcEvu9LRM",
